# Content Studio

- Visual SoT: Figma `ws9h9RE7NGrE9hVbwqRnxY`. Implement from design; do not invent alternate layouts.
- React 19 + Vite + TS strict. Refine **headless**. shadcn/ui new-york + Tailwind v4. No MUI.
- Orval-generated client/hooks only for platform HTTP — no hand-rolled fetch/Axios to `/api`.
- RHF + Zod for forms; map 422 paths. Sonner for toasts; actionable errors stay on page.
- Retain ETag → send `If-Match`. One `Idempotency-Key` per user intent across retries.
- Dashboard totals from `/dashboard/summary` only. Commerce UI never labels webhook as confirmed sale.
- pt-BR copy. Loading/empty/error/conflict/offline states per screen.
- CSS variables = tokens; CVA for finite variants; Lucide icons.
